    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107710/extras/12fd46fa46bcc89e6ccf742b12856aac.avif?t=1749284666\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br><i>Marine Battles</i> offers you a refreshed Battleship experience that is purely built for multiplayer! Create a lobby and play with your friends or go to battle with strangers. New options coming soon including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Password-protected private lobbies<br></li><li>Steam Friends integration<br></li><li>Customize lobbies with your own fleet configurations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107710/extras/a2bad1e33edc762b39ce38461abb3f2e.avif?t=1749284666\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>Ships in <i>Marine Battles</i> are not bound to the classic grid you know from the original Battleships. Place them freely within your battlefield section and play hide and seek with your opponent. For some reason they\u2019re still taking turns of 90 degrees, though. \ud83e\udd14<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107710/extras/f3b54e749acdb76ed3c8a11eb30df602.avif?t=1749284666\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>Gone are the cozy days of playing in turns. <i>Marine Battles</i> embraces the boiling heat of a naval battlefield in real-time battles. Use the different properties of your ships to seek and destroy the opponent\u2019s fleet as efficiently as possible.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107710/extras/12fd46fa46bcc89e6ccf742b12856aac.avif?t=1749284666\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br><i>Marine Battles</i> offers you a refreshed Battleship experience that is purely built for multiplayer! Create a lobby and play with your friends or go to battle with strangers. New options coming soon including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Password-protected private lobbies<br></li><li>Steam Friends integration<br></li><li>Customize lobbies with your own fleet configurations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107710/extras/a2bad1e33edc762b39ce38461abb3f2e.avif?t=1749284666\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>Ships in <i>Marine Battles</i> are not bound to the classic grid you know from the original Battleships. Place them freely within your battlefield section and play hide and seek with your opponent. For some reason they\u2019re still taking turns of 90 degrees, though. \ud83e\udd14<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107710/extras/f3b54e749acdb76ed3c8a11eb30df602.avif?t=1749284666\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>Gone are the cozy days of playing in turns. <i>Marine Battles</i> embraces the boiling heat of a naval battlefield in real-time battles. Use the different properties of your ships to seek and destroy the opponent\u2019s fleet as efficiently as possible.",
    "short_description": "Return to the naval battlefield and beat your enemies in fast-paced multiplayer battles! Place your ships freely instead of having a grid and battle in real-time instead turns. Use your fleet's strengths to sink the opponent's fleet first. Are you going to succeed?",
